! Peter.Koehler@awi.de
! 2025.1111
! Simulated atmospheric CO2 concentration with the BICYCLE-SE model for 3 scenarios for the last 4 Myr
! 
! column 1: Age (years before 1950)
! columns 2-4: atmospheric CO2 concentration (ppm) for different scenarios
! column  2: scenario SE+3C
! column  3: scenario SE++V6C
! column  4: scenario SE++V12C
! 
! This data set is used in the following study:
! Title       : Constraints on past CO2 and climate sensitivity from global temperature and sea level reconstructions across the Plio-Pleistocene
! Author      : Peter Köhler and Peter U. Clark
! Published   : Geophysical Research Letters (submitted)
!
